data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"\u003cHeader title=\\\"Colour Greeting\\\" /\u003e` in `App.jsx`). Requirement met at the application level; the empty nav is internal to `@codesweep-ai/ui`. | PASS |\\n| Footer text \\\"Built with the codesweep design system\\\" | Footer textContent matches exactly | PASS |\\n| Centred layout: greeting centred, buttons in a row beneath it, group in vertical middle, header top / footer bottom, small even gap | Geometry at 1280×720: h1 horizontal-centre offset 0px; button-row centre offset 0px; row top 32px below h1 bottom; greeting+buttons group vertical-centre offset 6px (sub-pixel rounding); header top = 0; footer bottom = viewport bottom; inter-button gaps 12px and 12px (even) | PASS |\\n| `Button` with `variant=\\\"secondary\\\"`, `size=\\\"md\\\"`; state via `useState`; nothing beyond AppShell/Header/Footer/Button | `src/App.jsx` source: matches exactly; no other components imported | PASS |\\n\\n### Real design-system use — all pass\\n\\n- `package.json` lists `\\\"@codesweep-ai/ui\\\": \\\"^0.3.0\\\"` (installed and bundled).\\n- Rendered page carries the package's `data-component` attributes:\\n  `AppShell`, `Header`, `Button` ×3, `Footer` (read from the served DOM).\\n- Greeting colours come from design-system tokens: the `h1` inline style is\\n  literally `color: var(--color-cat-1);` and updates to the other tokens on\\n  click; the token values (`#6f93c9`, `#d89259`, `#9e90cc`) resolve from\\n  `@codesweep-ai/ui`'s own `core.css`, not the app.\\n- No hex values anywhere in the application source (grep evidence above).\\n  Layout CSS uses `--space-*` / `--font-size-*` tokens.\\n\\n## Failures\\n\\nNone. Nothing to send back for correction.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Verification was done in one pass against the production build in my clone;\\n  server stopped afterwards. The app's working tree is untouched (read-only\\n  verification; the developer owns fixes).\\n- This report is also at\\n  `~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-verify-report.md`.\\n"},"index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793343986,"id":"chatcmpl-12c6ce20","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

